                <syl /><neume facs="#m-76ada783-0231-45c9-ac35-07db4cc63a49" type="podatus" xml:id="m-6348cc38-41e2-4232-b196-ec1ca730f220">
                  <nc xml:id="m-d08c7781-a72a-4098-9c0d-3ad201155228" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-773634cb-1ef8-447f-8c11-60e8eccc8a56" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-ddf4b2e6-8b7e-4c46-a30d-89ed79f1500a" facs="#m-b6ac4d98-eb1e-40e9-a9bf-57714766bc5d" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-0a9202a6-496a-4109-8a4f-f1151a1076a8"><lg xml:id="m-04450b96-cc34-479c-89ff-d68a3fed5241"><l xml:id="m-8f1359f4-e7a9-4dd1-ad57-7e2b1b659a4e" facs="#m-015e1b39-34bc-4789-a490-822a8ff15e53" label="text-like">The Five Absolutions.</l><l xml:id="m-ac7c1aea-7576-4816-b413-858c74f13a9c" facs="#m-edb18160-90c0-4005-bcf5-b31d7941660c" label="ambiguous">1824</l><l xml:id="m-f9d0ebab-9270-48b8-bb6d-9fdff1ecb8c3" facs="#m-edc9c4e2-13ae-4cd0-8878-524420a1eb91" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-b7732b56-e3f7-423e-aaf3-b41546720742" facs="#m-0d34776c-fcb0-4cb5-9301-ccccdd08a4f1" label="lyrics-like">AC, quaésumus Dómine, hanc lut sicut hic eum vera fides junxit</l><l xml:id="m-b903b530-c589-4d93-b292-d7f360a0d736" facs="#m-9e0be378-2cbf-413a-8a9f-e9d54edc432f" label="lyrics-like">cum servo tuo N. defúncto mi-] fidélium turmis; *ita illic eum tua</l><l xml:id="m-94ac6afa-a4c4-46c0-a88d-cb6d5e4ee4ae" facs="#m-78334fe5-a536-4aa7-b822-e0e44d6267d3" label="lyrics-like">sericórdiam, ut factórum suórum ]miserátio sóciet angélicis choris.</l><l xml:id="m-4f54bb66-c520-4047-adc6-f8629b3bf592" facs="#m-43b4776e-af66-41e1-b608-9746d7dc7eb9" label="lyrics-like">in poenis non recípiat vicem, qui l Per Christum Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-ceb3e097-e83f-47c3-a2a0-5cefe6cb87b3" facs="#m-ac8fe74c-284e-411a-aee0-3d1533cb7657" label="lyrics-like">tuam in votis ténuit voluntáte:K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-5f450417-a138-47a4-8f87-fe6ca9853afc" facs="#m-a5e77159-507a-4d01-a7a6-8546586eab73" label="lyrics-like">The Third Responsory: Dómine quando véneris. p. 1787, with the</l><l xml:id="m-6d59dac0-53b6-453a-afe2-6e7214146b03" facs="#m-550218ad-e358-4614-9925-8092a8736f53" label="lyrics-like">v. Réquiem aetérnam.</l><l xml:id="m-44224a92-2358-405c-820d-fc7ae3b4298f" facs="#m-2e630ade-0e6b-4117-b19e-c0c1a4fa6262" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie eléison. etc., p. 1768.</l><l xml:id="m-946c5350-321c-463a-bbde-5ed08ea06ca9" facs="#m-41beb170-6ac6-4a08-a907-97463ad51e34" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-c5c5ea03-14d7-4397-acf1-efaf01c0a68e" facs="#m-b27216f9-30f9-44ee-a4ee-81b77e9af457" label="lyrics-like">(Nclina Dómine aurem tuam ad cis ac lucis regióne constituas, *et</l><l xml:id="m-b60f2393-4a72-4085-8dfc-fc00fb7565de" facs="#m-49b49a06-9970-48fc-ad72-17782283c68f" label="lyrics-like">A preces nostras, quibus misericór-Sanctórum tuórum júbeas esse con¬</l><l xml:id="m-baf66e44-1edf-4762-bca3-53283fb8bb7e" facs="#m-4f2fdbeb-974a-48db-9b53-740a6c708275" label="lyrics-like">diam tuam súpplices deprecámur:tlsórtem. Per Christum Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-5392dda2-4019-419e-a3d8-bd7d0f54a389" facs="#m-9ae0e189-260c-4c94-9cf8-7c0d47c90340" label="lyrics-like">ut ánimam fámuli tui N. quam de nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-43372264-c918-4eaf-95f6-c3245638d85e" facs="#m-cb91a857-2ce4-4b9e-bc1e-26f3426a8edf" label="lyrics-like">hoc saécule migráre jussísti, in pa-I E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-27b7bf82-2e36-45c2-aadc-bfceb68c9958" facs="#m-8ed10861-2da3-46cb-9952-d9f3c7440414" label="lyrics-like">The Fourth Responsory: Ne recordéris. p. 1792, with the V. Réquiem</l><l xml:id="m-6425eaf4-51e2-462c-a83f-3b2617b15103" facs="#m-ac564dc0-913b-4526-a172-f389ba8e36b0" label="lyrics-like">aetérnam.</l><l xml:id="m-f1ef41bb-ad51-4c60-bd2a-853ef38e6e44" facs="#m-fb9a420c-d00c-488e-b5dd-13786196a1f5" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie eléison. etc., p. 1768.</l><l xml:id="m-5fc3d638-eb8a-4deb-af9f-e6ec93ed2f88" facs="#m-53275a7d-1577-441e-8d50-efff3e91a1f3" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-1a6b6725-1a76-4da7-9490-d01e3431b6fe" facs="#m-ffd6518f-7dc8-46df-b034-768b8bf50008" label="lyrics-like">H Bsólve, quaésumus Dómine, áni-eléctos tuos resuscitátus respiret</l><l xml:id="m-fb4a540e-82d0-4936-b31e-6f3eec888821" facs="#m-230d0d65-2f0f-48c2-ab58-3a73fb089059" label="lyrics-like">Il mam fámuli tui N. ab omni Per Christum Dóminum nostrüm.</l><l xml:id="m-db50d6c7-5756-4fa6-9fbc-e1eb03ec0daf" facs="#m-ae84d46e-2cff-40ef-9aad-465384dee20e" label="lyrics-like">vinculo delictórum: t ut in resur¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe3024ed-c0b3-4460-9f80-561fbafa1824" facs="#m-fd733f15-cfa2-4b7b-9bc2-5e681a9be64f" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-47d9eaae-2307-44e6-988e-0613737e07bb" facs="#m-653f4cff-e669-46b3-a398-2e4d86685f08" label="lyrics-like">rectiónis glória, * inter Sanctos et</l><l xml:id="m-dfc1f1c2-a29b-4e7e-ba35-dbd0640dfe85" facs="#m-6118124c-7442-4386-aaab-728f29f76d82" label="lyrics-like">The Firth and last Responsory: Libera me Dómine de morte</l><l xml:id="m-e8edcf26-9698-439a-8886-b692044d1cb5" facs="#m-71db338c-b668-4c81-9adf-0acc110d55a9" label="lyrics-like">aetérna. p. 1767, with its Versicles.</l><l xml:id="m-e84f515f-7af8-4e23-9d15-32ba2a9a1aa5" facs="#m-663eeebe-9479-449a-94a6-c1d8f8008378" label="lyrics-like">Kyrie eléison. etc., p. 1768.</l><l xml:id="m-a0b2538f-b749-46ee-a34d-c0112a2003a0" facs="#m-23dc0873-8577-4c65-91bf-ca7086eaf701" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-be14853d-110c-48d3-8b17-b2c8bd5a7b99" facs="#m-15c00f2e-67c5-4d55-ad5a-d7453046bd47" label="lyrics-like">I Bsólve, quaésumus Dómine, áni-l versatióne commísit, * tu vénia mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-dafc4c6a-5d6d-4694-af1e-5b4ea323cba4" facs="#m-123ba5ff-2a36-404b-8800-c82dcb72c2b8" label="lyrics-like">Il mam famuli tui N., ut defún-[ sericordissimae pietátis abstérge.</l><l xml:id="m-3a463ebf-feb4-42d0-900c-916e3d48d782" facs="#m-b21d481d-bcc7-47cf-a6eb-3f6b480d4be3" label="lyrics-like">ctus saéculo tibi vivat: t et quael Per Christum Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-0ef1a35a-5b9b-4e56-95a0-73511ba031e9" facs="#m-9da3e4b6-4cbd-4a3b-830c-39be58d89106" label="lyrics-like">per fragilitátem carnis humána con-1 N. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b4d80eb9-a5f2-42bf-83a5-0e35b8902581" facs="#m-990c0676-11e8-406b-bfa3-74a04b67fe2c" label="text-like">The Bishop, who officiates, gives his blessing, while saying:</l><l xml:id="m-3e07be5c-557d-478f-8b38-63ce95f85d3d" facs="#m-fd77b0db-254f-478f-b5ef-77fdb0e1c4a1" label="lyrics-like">v. Réquiem K aetérnam dóna éi Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-a022ce62-f278-4d84-bb4e-24eca54d6413" facs="#m-1ea8da5f-7862-4e46-ab86-aeb3181d8b48" label="lyrics-like">K. Et lux perpétua lúceat éi.</l><l xml:id="m-6cb01867-196c-4882-95a6-273640c0a184" facs="#m-34521171-8172-4c21-ae31-e4724eadfa60" label="text-like">The Cantors sing:</l><l xml:id="m-95c6f200-f05f-47ea-b06a-4e2bf907f623" facs="#m-694dfefe-c249-42c7-8082-f5d646f3757e" label="lyrics-like">V. Requi-éscat in pá-ce. H. Amen.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>